    {
      "version": "1.62.0",
      "releaseNotes": "What's new in Place Guesser\n\n• More variety: fixed a bug that could repeat the same country within a single game.\n• New rules: No Move and NMPZ (no move, no pan, no zoom) for players who want a real challenge.\n• Daily Challenge archive: missed a day? Replay the last 30 challenges.\n• Streak freezes: a missed day no longer wipes out your streak. You can repair a recently lost streak, too.\n• Panorama-first layout: the street view fills the screen, and you open the map when you're ready to guess.\n• Country medals in your Passport: bronze, silver and gold for every country you play.\n• Share your results, compare with friends in Game Center, and unlock new achievements.\n• Country Streak now scores correct guesses reliably, plus other fixes and improvements.",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-23T11:42:24Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.63.0",
      "releaseNotes": "What's new in Place Guesser\n\n• Keep your streak alive: in the evening, the Daily Challenge widget counts down to midnight if you haven't played yet.\n• New Lock Screen widgets for your streak and today's challenge.\n• Jump into the Daily Challenge from Control Center or the Action button.\n• Widgets now speak your language.\n• Fixed country cards that showed no picture, including Puerto Rico.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-01T20:48:41Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.64.0",
      "releaseNotes": "What's new in Place Guesser\n\nNew: Maps! 63 themed maps to explore: stadiums, capitals, airports, castles and 15 world cities.\n• Play 2 maps free every day.\n• See the name of each place after the round, and play again from the final score.\n• Apple Watch: now in your language, with haptics and Double Tap.\n• A cleaner Home screen and a loading indicator for street view.\n• Fixed a crash when closing full-screen view.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-04T19:06:46Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.64.1",
      "releaseNotes": "What's new in Place Guesser\n\n• Fixed an issue where Pro could stay locked after subscribing. If it happened to you, just open the app: your subscription now unlocks on its own.\n",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-05T23:04:44Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.65.0",
      "releaseNotes": "What's new in Place Guesser\n\nNew: Pass the Phone! One phone, everyone plays. Take turns guessing where in the world the map is.\n• Four games: Pass the Phone, Knockout, Family Team and Solo Map Quiz.\n• Pick an animal for each player and chase the family record.\n• Relaxed difficulty, great for kids and first timers.\n• Find it in Modes.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-09T15:57:28Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.65.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Bug fixes and performance improvements.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-16T16:16:47Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.66.0",
      "releaseNotes": "What's new in Place Guesser\n\n• Every round now scores out of 5,000, like the Daily Challenge and multiplayer. Your records and country medals were converted, so you keep everything you earned.\n• Results come alive: the points count up with sound and haptics, and the best guesses sparkle. Sound effects, Home music and haptics each have a switch in Settings.\n• Thailand is on the map: new Apple Look Around places in Bangkok, Chiang Mai, Phuket, Ayutthaya and more, free to play.\n• Cleaner screens: a simpler Home, a clearer round result and a lighter game screen.\n• Easier to read and tap: layouts adapt to large text, controls are bigger and better labelled for VoiceOver.\n• Clearer Pro prices: every plan shows its billing period.\n• Fixes and improvements.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-19T00:33:17Z"
    },
